n an undisclosed reservation. Six communities were sampled in July 2018 within sewer networks upstream of terminal lagoon systems, and chemical indicators of opioids, opioid treatment medication, stimulants, alcohol, nicotine, caffeine, and an over-the-counter cough suppressant were measured.','2026-06-15 20:40:21','2026-06-15 20:40:21'),(161,'药物类','阿片类药物','合成阿片类镇痛药','芬太尼','Rx/Designer opioid','处方药','芬太尼','437-38-7',NULL,16.700000,6.0000,15.3500,'mg/day/1000 people',NULL,NULL,'Wastewater-based epidemiology; Wastewater infrastructure; Substance use; Licit and illicit drugs','10.1016/j.scitotenv.2022.153882','Healthcare access and health-related information for American Indian/Alaska Native communities is often limited. This study assessed wastewater infrastructure connectivity for major tribal reservations and performed a WBE sampling campaign on an undisclosed reservation. Six communities were sampled in July 2018 within sewer networks upstream of terminal lagoon systems, and chemical indicators of opioids, opioid treatment medication, stimulants, alcohol, nicotine, caffeine, and an over-the-counter cough suppressant were measured.','2026-06-15 20:40:21','2026-06-15 20:40:21'),(162,'消费类','烟草','尼古丁及代谢物','尼古丁',NULL,'其他','可替宁 + trans-3\'-羟基可替宁','486-56-6; 34834-67-8',NULL,1.350000,74.0000,4.6300,'g/day/1000 people',NULL,NULL,'Wastewater-based epidemiology; Wastewater infrastructure; Substance use; Licit and illicit drugs','10.1016/j.scitotenv.2022.153882','Healthcare access and health-related information for American Indian/Alaska Native communities is often limited. This study assessed wastewater infrastructure connectivity for major tribal reservations and performed a WBE sampling campaign on an undisclosed reservation. Six communities were sampled in July 2018 within sewer networks upstream of terminal lagoon systems, and chemical indicators of opioids, opioid treatment medication, stimulants, alcohol, nicotine, caffeine, and an over-the-counter cough suppressant were measured.','2026-06-15 20:40:21','2026-06-15 20:40:21'),(163,'暴露/生活方式标志物','环境暴露标志物','内分泌干扰物/双酚类','双酚A',NULL,'其他','双酚A','80-05-7','分子量228.3 g/mol；水溶性71 mg/L(25°C)；LogKow 3.641；饱和蒸气压5.34E-7 mm Hg',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'Bisphenol analogues; Biomonitoring; Wastewater-based epidemiology; South China','10.1016/j.envres.2021.112398','Bisphenol analogues (BPs) are heavily used and negatively affect the health of human beings, however, there is little knowledge regarding human exposure to BPs other than BPA. This study aims to assess human exposure to BPs through investigating pooled urine and wastewater samples. Twenty-four pooled urine samples were prepared from 960 specimens. Wastewater samples were collected from six major wastewater treatment plants in Guangzhou, South of China. BPA, BPS, and BPAF were widely detected in urine samples. Most BPs were detected in wastewater samples, of which BPA and BPS were predominant BPs. Urinary BPA, BPS, and BPAF accounted for less than 5% per capital mass loads in wastewater, suggesting that much of the BPA, BPS, and BPAF in municipal wastewater originate non-human excretion. Hence, the wastewater-based epidemiology approach based on parent compounds is not available for assessing human exposure to BPs, neither for other industrial chemicals with diverse sources in municipal wastewater.','2026-06-15 20:40:21','2026-06-15 20:40:21'),(164,'暴露/生活方式标志物','环境暴露标志物','内分泌干扰物/双酚类似物','双酚B',NULL,'其他','双酚B','77-40-7','分子量242.3 g/mol；水溶性44 mg/L(25°C)；LogKow 4.15；饱和蒸气压2.2E-7 mm Hg',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'Bisphenol analogues; Biomonitoring; Wastewater-based epidemiology; South China','10.1016/j.envres.2021.112398','Bisphenol analogues (BPs) are heavily used and negatively affect the health of human beings, however, there is little knowledge regarding human exposure to BPs other than BPA. This study aims to assess human exposure to BPs through investigating pooled urine and wastewater samples. Twenty-four pooled urine samples we