inant consumption and prevalence contributors, and depression prevalence was estimated from antidepressant use prevalence.','2026-06-15 20:40:21','2026-06-15 20:40:21'),(247,'药物类','精神神经类药物','三环类抗抑郁药','阿米替林','抑郁症/精神障碍','处方药','去甲替林','72-69-5','分子式 C19H21N；分子量 263.4 g/mol',35.105000,3.0000,466.0000,'mg/day/1000 inh',0.2160,27.0000,'Antidepressants; Wastewater-based epidemiology; Depression; Prevalence; Qinghai Province','10.1016/j.scitotenv.2023.163303','Wastewater-based epidemiology was used to estimate antidepressant consumption and depression prevalence in five cities of Qinghai Province, West China. Antidepressants were measured in influent and effluent wastewater from 17 wastewater treatment plants. Venlafaxine, desvenlafaxine, paroxetine, sertraline and nortriptyline were among the highest concentration quartile in influent samples. Back-calculation estimated venlafaxine, desvenlafaxine-based venlafaxine, paroxetine, sertraline and amitriptyline as the dominant consumption and prevalence contributors, and depression prevalence was estimated from antidepressant use prevalence.','2026-06-15 20:40:21','2026-06-15 20:40:21'),(248,'药物类','精神神经类药物','三环类抗抑郁药','多塞平','抑郁症/精神障碍','处方药','多塞平','1668-19-5','分子式 C19H21NO；分子量 279.4 g/mol',NULL,NULL,38.0000,'mg/day/1000 inh',0.0240,27.0000,'Antidepressants; Wastewater-based epidemiology; Depression; Prevalence; Qinghai Province','10.1016/j.scitotenv.2023.163303','Wastewater-based epidemiology was used to estimate antidepressant consumption and depression prevalence in five cities of Qinghai Province, West China. Antidepressants were measured in influent and effluent wastewater from 17 wastewater treatment plants. Venlafaxine, desvenlafaxine, paroxetine, sertraline and nortriptyline were among the highest concentration quartile in influent samples. Back-calculation estimated venlafaxine, desvenlafaxine-based venlafaxine, paroxetine, sertraline and amitriptyline as the dominant consumption and prevalence contributors, and depression