d liquid chromatography tandem mass spectrometry method for estimating the population-normalized mass loads of 35 analgesic biomarkers in wastewater. The analytes included non-steroidal anti-inflammatory drugs and opioids, as well as other pain-related substances and metabolites. Influent wastewater samples from four municipal wastewater treatment plants in Australia were collected over seven consecutive days and analyzed to support WBE assessment of analgesic consumption.','2026-06-15 20:40:21','2026-06-15 20:40:21'),(277,'药物类','消炎镇痛药','非甾体抗炎药','水杨酸','疼痛治疗相关药物监测','非处方药','水杨酸','69-72-7','分子式C7H6O3；单同位素质量138.031693 Da',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'NSAIDs; Opioids; Pain; LC-MS/MS; Wastewater-based epidemiology','10.1016/j.talanta.2021.122627','Wastewater-based epidemiology (WBE) is a useful tool for quantifying drug consumption as a function of time and place. This study proposed a validated liquid chromatography tandem mass spectrometry method for estimating the population-normalized mass loads of 35 analgesic biomarkers in wastewater. The analytes included non-steroidal anti-inflammatory drugs and opioids, as well as other pain-related substances and metabolites. Influent wastewater samples from four municipal wastewater treatment plants in Australia were collected over seven consecutive days and analyzed to support WBE assessment of analgesic consumption.','2026-06-15 20:40:21','2026-06-15 20:40:21'),(278,'药物类','阿片类药物','阿片类镇痛药','哌替啶','疼痛治疗相关药物监测','处方药','哌替啶','57-42-1','分子式C15H21NO2；单同位素质量247.157227 Da',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'NSAIDs; Opioids; Pain; LC-MS/MS; Wastewater-based epidemiology','10.1016/j.talanta.2021.122627','Wastewater-based epidemiology (WBE) is a useful tool for quantifying drug consumption as a function of time and place. This study proposed a validated liquid chromatography tandem mass spectrometry method for estimating the population-normalized mass loads of 35 analgesic biomarkers in wastewater. The analytes included non-steroidal anti-i