Australia were collected over seven consecutive days and analyzed to support WBE assessment of analgesic consumption.','2026-06-15 20:40:21','2026-06-15 20:40:21'),(281,'药物类','阿片类药物','阿片部分激动剂/替代治疗药物','丁丙诺啡','疼痛治疗相关药物监测','处方药','丁丙诺啡','52485-79-7','分子式C29H41NO4；单同位素质量467.303558 Da',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'NSAIDs; Opioids; Pain; LC-MS/MS; Wastewater-based epidemiology','10.1016/j.talanta.2021.122627','Wastewater-based epidemiology (WBE) is a useful tool for quantifying drug consumption as a function of time and place. This study proposed a validated liquid chromatography tandem mass spectrometry method for estimating the population-normalized mass loads of 35 analgesic biomarkers in wastewater. The analytes included non-steroidal anti-inflammatory drugs and opioids, as well as other pain-related substances and metabolites. Influent wastewater samples from four municipal wastewater treatment plants in Australia were collected over seven consecutive days and analyzed to support WBE assessment of analgesic consumption.','2026-06-15 20:40:21','2026-06-15 20:40:21'),(282,'药物类','阿片类药物','阿片类镇痛药','Oxymorphone','疼痛治疗相关药物监测','处方药','Oxymorphone','76-41-5','分子式C17H19NO4；单同位素质量301.131409 Da',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'NSAIDs; Opioids; Pain; LC-MS/MS; Wastewater-based epidemiology','10.1016/j.talanta.2021.122627','Wastewater-based epidemiology (WBE) is a useful tool for quantifying drug consumption as a function of time and place. This study proposed a validated liquid chromatography tandem mass spectrometry method for estimating the population-normalized mass loads of 35 analgesic biomarkers in wastewater. The analytes included non-steroidal anti-inflammatory drugs and opioids, as well as other pain-related substances and metabolites. Influent wastewater samples from four municipal wastewater treatment plants in Australia were collected over seven consecutive days and analyzed to support WBE assessment of analgesic consumption.','2026-06-15 20:40:21','2026-06-15 20:40:21'),(283,'药物类','消炎镇痛药','非甾体抗炎药','帕瑞昔布','疼痛治疗相关药物监测','处方药','帕瑞昔布','198470-84-7','分子式C19H18N2O4S；单同位素质量370.098724 Da',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'NSAIDs; Opioids; Pain; LC-MS/MS; Wastewater-based epidemiology','10.1016/j.talanta.2021.122627','Wastewater-based epidemiology (WBE) is a useful tool for quantifying drug consumption as a function of time and place. This study proposed a validated liquid chromatography tandem mass spectrometry method for estimating the population-normalized mass loads of 35 analgesic biomarkers in wastewater. The analytes included non-steroidal anti-inflammatory drugs and opioids, as well as other pain-related substances and metabolites. Influent wastewater samples from four municipal wastewater treatment plants in Australia were collected over seven consecutive days and analyzed to support WBE assessment of analgesic consumption.','2026-06-15 20:40:21','2026-06-15 20:40:21'),(284,'消费类','烟草','尼古丁及代谢物','尼古丁','烟草/尼古丁消费监测','其他','3-羟基可替宁','205246-48-6','pKa 13.0；分子量192.21；LogKow -1.48',1.350000,74.0000,3.4000,'mg nicotine/person aged 15+/da',20.0000,NULL,'Wastewater-based epidemiology; Urban metabolism metrology; Public health monitoring','10.1016/j.scitotenv.2018.11.350','Wastewater-based epidemiology (WBE) was used to monitor alcohol and tobacco consumption in three U.S. communities. Raw wastewater was collected monthly from three U.S. cities as 24-h weekday composites over an 11-month sampling period. Ethyl sulfate, nicotine, cotinine, and 3-hydroxycotinine were measured by isotope dilution liquid chromatography tandem mass spectrometry. Average per-capita alcohol and nicotine consumption rates were back-calculated using biomarker levels, wastewater flow, metabolic excretion factors, and population size data, and were compared with survey statistics.','2026-06-15 20:40:21','2026-06-15 20:40:21'),(285,'药物类','阿片类药物','阿片维持治疗药物','美沙酮','海洛因依赖/阿片依赖维持治疗','处方药','美沙酮主要代谢物','30223-73-5',NULL,NULL,55.0000,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'Heroin; Codeine; Morphine; Drug consumption; Wastewater-based epidemiology; Methadone maintenance services','10.1016/j.drugalcdep.2019.06.034','Background: Methadone maintenance treatment (MMT) services have been used in China for treatment of heroin dependence. But no study has been conducted to assess the appropriateness of MMT distribution and the potential abuse of methadone in China. This study aims to do that through a nationwide estimation of methadone consumption in China via wastewater-based epidemiology and subsequently compare it with MMT data and level of heroin abuse. Methods: Wastewater samples were collected from 53 wastewater treatment plants in 27 major cities that cover all geographic regions of China. Methadone and pure heroin consumptions were estimated based on influent concentrations of methadone, 2-ethylidene-1,5-dimethyl-3,3-diphenylpyrrolidine (EDDP), morphine and codeine. Results: Drug residues were detected in most samples. The ratio of EDDP/methadone was around 2 in influents and methadone and EDDP loads were strongly correlated, indicating that they originated from human consumption. Both influent methadone and EDDP loads in Southwest and Northwest China were significantly higher than those in other regions. The highest estimated consumptions of methadone and heroin in China were 22.0 +/- 2.1 mg/1000 in./d and 263.9 +/- 115.9 mg/1000 in./d, respectively. There was a significant positive correlation between methadone and heroin consumptions. Conclusions: Consumption of methadone in China was primarily from MMT services. The use of methadone and heroin displayed a clear geographical pattern: it is higher in the western inland regions than in the eastern regions. This study has shown that the distribution of MMT services is reflective of the level of heroin abuse in different regions of China.','2026-06-15 20:40:21','2026-06-15 20:40:21'),(286,'药物类','抗生素','磺胺类','磺胺二甲嘧啶',NULL,'处方药','磺胺二甲嘧啶','57-68-1','分子式C12H14N4O2S；分子量278.3；水溶解度1500 mg/L；pKa 7.59；LogKow 0.89',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'Wastewater based epidemiology; Diffusive gradient in thin film; Illicit drugs; Antibiotics; Hanoi; Guangzhou','10.1016/j.scitotenv.2021.145480','There is a need for a simple water sampling technique to enable routine monitoring of community drug consumption through wastewater-based epidemiology (WBE). This study investigates the potential use of diffusive gradients in thin films to sample organic compounds (o-DGT) for WBE. Three types of resin gels (HLB, XAD 18, and XDA-1) within o-DGT samplers each were deployed in triplicate at the inlets of two sewage treatment plants of Southern Asian cities. The target compounds included 15 illicit drugs and 18 antibiotics. A comprehensive evaluation was undertaken regarding each resin\'s ability to accumulate the target compounds and accuracy by comparing active samples. The organic compounds accumulated on each resin gel were characterised at the molecular level using Fourier transform ion-cyclotron-resonance mass spectrometry (FT-ICR MS). The results showed that the HLB resin performed better than the XAD 18 and XDA-1 resins. Based on calculations using the HLB-DGT data, methamphetamine and heroin were the two most popular illicit drugs consumed among the studied populations, and were followed by ketamine and codeine, which agreed well with the authoritative reports and reference data. The total drug consumption in Hanoi was one order of magnitude higher than that in Guangzhou, thus implying a probably more serious drug situation in the former. Overall, the findings of this study demonstrate that o-DGT passive samplers are a promising tool for WBE studies, particularly at WWTPs or in urban streams where an automatic sampler for taking composite water samples is absent. (C) 2021 Elsevier B.V. All rights reserved.','2026-06-15 20:40:21','2026-06-15 20:40:21'),(287,'药物类','抗生素','喹诺酮类','恩诺沙星',NULL,'处方药','恩诺沙星','93106-60-6','分子式C19H22FN3O3；分子量359.4；水溶解度64.6 mg/L；pKa NA；LogKow 0.804',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NU