n South-West England: a small commuter town Keynsham and the city of Bath (>180 samples collected). The study triangulated WBE and NHS prescription data to understand pain treatment patterns, seasonal NSAID and paracetamol use, chronic pain medication patterns, topical versus oral use, and challenges in back-calculating intake from wastewater.','2026-06-15 20:40:21','2026-06-15 20:40:21'),(308,'药物类','消炎镇痛药','非甾体抗炎药','双氯芬酸','疼痛治疗；NSAIDs/analgesics','处方药','4\'-羟基双氯芬酸','64118-84-9',NULL,8.970000,10.5800,543.0000,'mg/day/1000 inh',NULL,NULL,'Water fingerprinting; Chemical mining; WBE; Wastewater-based epidemiology; Human exposure; Pain; NSAIDs; Analgesics','10.1016/j.watres.2022.119391','This paper explores Wastewater-Based Epidemiology (WBE) as a tool enabling understanding of city\'s pain treatment in an intercity longitudinal study. An intensive 13-month monitoring programme was undertaken in two adjacent urban areas in South-West England: a small commuter town Keynsham and the city of Bath (>180 samples collected). The study triangulated WBE and NHS prescription data to understand pain treatment patterns, seasonal NSAID and paracetamol use, chronic pain medication patterns, topical versus oral use, and challenges in back-calculating intake from wastewater.','2026-06-15 20:40:21','2026-06-15 20:40:21'),(309,'药物类','精神神经类药物','抗癫痫/神经病理性疼痛用药','普瑞巴林','疼痛治疗；nerve-pain/chronic pain','处方药','N-甲基普瑞巴林','1155843-61-0',NULL,102.120000,0.9000,1968.0000,'mg/day/1000 inh',NULL,NULL,'Water fingerprinting; Chemical mining; WBE; Wastewater-based epidemiology; Human exposure; Pain; NSAIDs; Analgesics','10.1016/j.watres.2022.119391','This paper explores Wastewater-Based Epidemiology (WBE) as a tool enabling understanding of city\'s pain treatment in an intercity longitudinal study. An intensive 13-month monitoring programme was undertaken in two adjacent urban areas in South-West England: a small commuter town Keynsham and the city of Bath (>180 samples collected). The study triangulate