 correlations found was between Antihyperlipidemics and Antihypertensives, with Pearson\'s correlation coefficient of 0.82.','2026-06-15 20:40:21','2026-06-15 20:40:21'),(329,'人群校正类','人群校正标志物','儿茶酚胺代谢物','人口校正标志物','WBE人口估计/归一化','其他','香草扁桃酸','55-10-7',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'Liquid chromatography; Mass spectrometry; Vanillylmandelic acid; Homovanillic acid; Population proxy','10.1016/j.scitotenv.2020.142992','Wastewater-based epidemiology studies use catchment populations to normalise chemical marker mass loads in 24-h composite wastewater samples. This study evaluated the catecholamine metabolites homovanillic acid (HVA) and vanillylmandelic acid (VMA) as potential population biomarkers. Influent wastewater 24-h composite samples were collected from 38 wastewater catchments around Australia and analysed by LC-MS/MS. Measured mass loads were compared to census-derived population sizes; HVA and VMA showed r2 of 0.908 and 0.922, respectively.','2026-06-15 20:40:21','2026-06-15 20:40:21'),(330,'人群校正类','人群校正标志物','儿茶酚胺代谢物','人口校正标志物','WBE人口估计/归一化','其他','高香草酸','306-08-1',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'Liquid chromatography; Mass spectrometry; Vanillylmandelic acid; Homovanillic acid; Population proxy','10.1016/j.scitotenv.2020.142992','Wastewater-based epidemiology studies use catchment populations to normalise chemical marker mass loads in 24-h composite wastewater samples. This study evaluated the catecholamine metabolites homovanillic acid (HVA) and vanillylmandelic acid (VMA) as potential population biomarkers. Influent wastewater 24-h composite samples were collected from 38 wastewater catchments around Australia and analysed by LC-MS/MS. Measured mass loads were compared to census-derived population sizes; HVA and VMA showed r2 of 0.908 and 0.922, respectively.','2026-06-15 20:40:21','2026-06-15 20:40:21'),(331,'药物类','造影剂','碘造影剂','碘普罗胺','医学影像造影','处方药','碘普罗胺','73334-07-3',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'Wastewater-based epidemiology; Pharmaceuticals; Chronic diseases; Lifestyle; Medications','10.1016/j.wroa.2025.100335','This study used wastewater-based epidemiology to compare medication use and health-related biomarkers between an urban catchment and a university-town catchment in China. Wastewater samples from 2017-2018 were analyzed for OTC medications, prescribed drugs, chronic-disease medications, and selected lifestyle biomarkers.','2026-06-15 20:40:21','2026-06-15 20:40:21'),(332,'药物类','精神神经类药物','抗抑郁药','米氮平','论文研究抗抑郁药消费；正文讨论抑郁、焦虑、失眠等心理健康背景','处方药','去甲米氮平','61337-68-6',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'Antidepressants; Wastewater-based epidemiology; Spatiotemporal trends; Slovenia; COVID-19','10.1016/j.scitotenv.2023.166586','This study used wastewater-based epidemiology to evaluate spatiotemporal changes in antidepressant consumption in Slovenia before and during the COVID-19 pandemic. Twenty-four-hour composite influent wastewater samples from six wastewater treatment plants were analysed by LC-MS/MS and converted to population-normalised mass loads.','2026-06-15 20:40:21','2026-06-15 20:40:21'),(333,'药物类','精神神经类药物','5-羟色胺拮抗和再摄取抑制剂','曲唑酮','论文研究抗抑郁药消费；正文讨论抑郁等心理健康背景。','处方药','间氯苯基哌嗪','6640-24-0',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'Wastewater-based epidemiology; Antidepressants; Mass-spectrometric analysis; Validation; Stability; Matrix effects','10.1016/j.talanta.2019.03.052','A bioanalytical SPE-LC-MS/MS method was developed and validated for a broad range of antidepressants and metabolites in influent wastewater. The method was applied to 24-h composite influent wastewater samples from four Belgian WWTPs; 18 biomarkers were detected above the LLOQ and population-normalised loads were reported.','2026-06-15 20:40:21','2026-06-15 20:40:21'),(334,'药物类','精神神经类药物','三环类抗抑郁药','去甲替林','论文研究抗抑郁药消费；正文讨论抑郁等心理健康背景。','处方药','去甲替林','72-69-5',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'Wastewater-based epidemiology; Antidepressants; Mass-spectrometric analysis; Validation; Stability; Matrix effects','10.1016/j.talanta.2019.03.052','A bioanalytical SPE-LC-MS/MS method was developed and validated for a broad range of antidepressants and metabolites in influent wastewater. The method was applied to 24-h composite influent wastewater samples from four Belgian WWTPs; 18 biomarkers were detected above the LLOQ and population-normalised loads were reported.','2026-06-15 20:40:21','2026-06-15 20:40:21'),(335,'药物类','阿片类药物','阿片类镇痛药','Morphine','疼痛镇痛','处方药','Normorphine','466-97-7',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'Wastewater-based epidemiology; Opioids; Mass-spectrometric analysis; Validation; Stability; Process efficiency','10.1016/j.talanta.2021.122443','The study optimised and validated an LC-MS/MS method for multiple opioids in influent wastewater, then monitored five Belgian locations (2019) for community consumption pattern assessment. It reports population-normalized mass loads (mg/day/1000 inhabitants) by location and month.','2026-06-15 20:40:21','2026-06-15 20:40:21'),(336,'药物类','阿片类药物','阿片类代谢物','Tilidine','疼痛镇痛','处方药','Nortilidine','38677-94-0',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'Wastewater-based epidemiology; Opioids; Mass-spectrometric analysis; Validation; Stability; Process efficiency','10.1016/j.talanta.2021.122443','The study optimised and validated an LC-MS/MS method for multiple opioids in influent wastewater, then monitored five Belgian locations (2019) for community consumption pattern assessment. It reports population-normalized mass loads (mg/day/1000 inhabitants) by location and month.','2026-06-15 20:40:21','2026-06-15 20:40:21'),(337,'药物类','阿片类药物','阿片类代谢物','Tilidine','疼痛镇痛','处方药','Tilidine','51931-66-9',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'Wastewater-based epidemiology; Opioids; Mass-spectrometric analysis; Validation; Stability; Process efficiency','10.1016/j.talanta.2021.122443','The study optimised and validated an LC-MS/MS method for multiple opioids in influent wastewater, then monitored five Belgian locations (2019) for community consumption pattern assessment. It reports population-normalized mass loads (mg/day/1000 inhabitants) by location and month.','2026-06-15 20:40:21','2026-06-15 20:40:21'),(338,'药物类','降压药/心血管用药','外周血管扩张/血流改善药','己酮可可碱','外周血管疾病治疗','处方药','己酮可可碱','6493-05-6',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'Pharmaceuticals; Solid-phase extraction; Liquid chromatography-tandem mass spectrometry; Influent wastewater; Wastewater-based epidemiology','10.1016/j.microc.2023.109131','The occurrence of pharmaceuticals in influent wastewater samples (IWW) is a recurrent issue. The work developed an SPE-LC-MS/MS method for seventeen pharmaceuticals and applied it to 42 24-h composite influent wastewater samples from six WWTPs across Spain. Concentrations ranged from <MQL to 10393 ng/L, and population normalized daily loads were calculated to compare pharmaceutical use patterns.','2026-06-15 20:40:21','2026-06-15 20:40:21'),(339,'药物类','精神神经类药物','抗精神病药','喹硫平','精神障碍治疗','处方药','喹硫平','111974-69-7',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'Pharmaceuticals; Solid-phase extraction; Liquid chromatography-tandem mass spectrometry; Influent wastewater; Wastewater-based epidemiology','10.1016/j.microc.2023.109131','The occurrence of pharmaceuticals in influent wastewater samples (IWW) is a recurrent issue. The work developed an SPE-LC-MS/MS method for seventeen pharmaceuticals and applied it to 42 24-h composite influent wastewater samples from six WWTPs across Spain. Concentrations ranged from <MQL to 10393 ng/L, and population normalized daily loads were calculated to compare pharmaceutical use patterns.','2026-06-15 20:40:21','2026-06-15 20:40:21'),(340,'药物类','抗消化性溃疡药','质子泵抑制剂','奥美拉唑','胃酸相关疾病/消化性溃疡治疗','非处方药','奥美拉唑','73590-58-6',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'Pharmaceuticals; Solid-phase extraction; Liquid chromatography-tandem mass spectrometry; Influent wastewater; Wastewater-based epidemiology','10.1016/j.microc.2023.109131','The occurrence of pharmaceuticals in influent wastewater samples (IWW) is a recurrent issue. The work developed an SPE-LC-MS/MS method for seventeen pharmaceuticals and applied it to 42 24-h composite influent wastewater samples from six WWTPs across Spain. Concentrations ranged from <MQL to 10393 ng/L, and population normalized daily loads were calculated to compare pharmaceutical use patterns.','2026-06-15 20:40:21','2026-06-15 20:40:21'),(341,'健康状态类','健康状态标志物','组胺代谢标志物','组胺代谢/人口健康负担','过敏及组胺相关炎症负担','其他','1,4-甲基咪唑乙酸','2625-49-2',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'Wastewater-based epidemiology; Histamine; Allergy; Antihistamine; Population health; LC-MS/MS','10.1016/j.envint.2018.08.009','Systematic sampling and analysis of wastewater was used to evaluate population histamine burden using 1,4-methylimidazoleacetic acid (MIAA), an endogenous metabolite of histamine turnover, and to compare its occurrence with antihistamine use. Consecutive daily influent samples were collected from seven Australian catchments during the 2016 Census. MIAA, ranitidine, fexofenadine and cetirizine were quantified, and per capita loads were compared across catchments and in sewer-reactor stability experiments.','2026-06-15 20:40:21','2026-06-15 20:40:21'),(342,'药物类','抗生素','大环内酯类','红霉素','感染性疾病治疗/抗微生物用药监测','处方药','N-去甲基红霉素','992-62-1',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'WBE; antibiotics; antivirals; antimicrobial resistance; prescription; data triangulation; direct disposal','10.1016/j.jhazmat.2023.131461','本研究在英国西南部 Bath 与 Keynsham 两个社区污水汇水区开展13个月纵向 WBE 研究，用24 h流量比例复合进水样监测抗微生物药及代谢物的污水负荷，并将污水估算摄入量与 catchment 处方数据、人口数据进行比较。','2026-06-15 20:40:21','2026-06-15 20:40:21'),(343,'药物类','抗生素','大环内酯类','克拉霉素','感染性疾病治疗/抗微生物用药监测','处方药','N-去甲基克拉霉素','101666-68-6',NULL,18.200000,NULL,1377.0103,'mg/day/1000 inh',NULL,NULL,'WBE; antibiotics; antivirals; antimicrobial resistance; prescription; data triangulation; direct disposal','10.1016/j.jhazmat.2023.131461','本研究在英国西南部 Bath 与 Keynsham 两个社区污水汇水区开展13个月纵向 WBE 研究，用24 h流量比例复合进水样监测抗微生物药及代谢物的污水负荷，并将污水估算摄入量与 catchment 处方数据、人口数据进行比较。','2026-06-15 20:40:21','2026-06-15 20:40