scitotenv.2021.149860','Exploring the contamination profile of multi-class emerging contaminants in wastewater is highly desirable. This study investigated occurrence, removal, mass loading and risks for pharmaceuticals and personal care products, illicit drugs, perfluorinated compounds and organophosphate flame retardants in two WWTPs in Thessaloniki, Greece. Influent and effluent wastewaters were extracted by Oasis HLB SPE and analyzed by UHPLC-Orbitrap MS. Caffeine, acetaminophen, irbesartan and valsartan were among the most ubiquitous and elevated compounds, and mass loading plus ecological risk assessment were reported.','2026-06-15 20:40:21','2026-06-15 20:40:21'),(452,'药物类','降压药/心血管用药','抗血小板药','氯吡格雷','抗血小板治疗','处方药','氯吡格雷','113665-84-2','分子式C16H16ClNO2S；分子量321.06；水溶解度50.78 mg/L(25°C)；logKow 3.80；pKa 5.3',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'Emerging contaminants; Environmental risk; High-resolution mass spectrometry; Greece; Organophosphate flame retardants; Perfluorinated compounds','10.1016/j.scitotenv.2021.149860','Exploring the contamination profile of multi-class emerging contaminants in wastewater is highly desirable. This study investigated occurrence, removal, mass loading and risks for pharmaceuticals and personal care products, illicit drugs, perfluorinated compounds and organophosphate flame retardants in two WWTPs in Thessaloniki, Greece. Influent and effluent wastewaters were extracted by Oasis HLB SPE and analyzed by UHPLC-Orbitrap MS. Caffeine, acetaminophen, irbesartan and valsartan were among the most ubiquitous and elevated compounds, and mass loading plus ecological risk assessment were reported.','2026-06-15 20:40:21','2026-06-15 20:40:21'),(453,'药物类','造影剂','碘造影剂','泛影酸',NULL,'处方药','泛影酸','117-96-4','分子式 C11H9I3N2O4；LogKow 2.6',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'Wastewater epidemiology; Micropollutants; Chemicals of emerging concern; Removal efficiency; Wastewater treatment; Pharmaceuticals; GC × GC-QToF; LC-QToFMS','10.1007/s11356-023-30331-z','This study aimed to investigate the spatial distribution of micropollutants in wastewater related to catchment area, and their environmental risks and fate. About 24-h flow proportional effluent wastewater samples were collected from eight WWTPs across Denmark, and corresponding influent samples were collected from five WWTPs. Samples were enriched by multi-layer solid phase extraction and analysed by liquid chromatography-high-resolution mass spectrometry and comprehensive two-dimensional gas chromatography with high-resolution mass spectrometry detection. The study detected and quantified 79 micropollutants from a list of 291 micropollutants in at least one influent or effluent wastewater sample, evaluated removal and effluent risk, and compared selected pharmaceuticals with sale-number and excretion based estimates.','2026-06-15 20:40:21','2026-06-15 20:40:21'),(454,'药物类','抗生素','磺胺类','磺胺甲噻唑',NULL,'处方药','磺胺甲噻唑','144-82-1','分子式 C9H10N4O2S2；LogKow 0.41',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'Wastewater epidemiology; Micropollutants; Chemicals of emerging concern; Removal efficiency; Wastewater treatment; Pharmaceuticals; GC × GC-QToF; LC-QToFMS','10.1007/s11356-023-30331-z','This study aimed to investigate the spatial distribution of micropollutants in wastewater related to catchment area, and their environmental risks and fate. About 24-h flow proportional effluent wastewater samples were collected from eight WWTPs across Denmark, and corresponding influent samples were collected from five WWTPs. Samples were enriched by multi-layer solid phase extraction and analysed by liquid chromatography-high-resolution mass spectrometry and comprehensive two-dimensional gas chromatography with high-resolution mass spectrometry detection. The study detected and quantified 79 micropollutants from a list of 291 micropollutants in at least one influent or effluent wastewater sample, evaluated removal and effluent risk, and compared selected pharmaceuticals with sale-number and excretion based estimates.','2026-06-15 20:40:21','2026-06-15 20:40:21'),(455,'消费类','酒精','酒精消费标志物','乙醇',NULL,'其他','乙基葡萄糖醛酸苷','17685-04-0','MW 222.2; water solubility 480,000 mg/L at 25 C; logKow -0.90',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'Alcohol and tobacco; Benchmarking; Biomarker stability; LC-MS/MS; Wastewater-based epidemiology','10.1016/j.watres.2018.03.036','This study evaluated the in-sewer stability of alcohol and tobacco consumption biomarkers in the UC9 real rising main sewer in Gold Coast, Queensland, Australia. Ethyl sulphate, ethyl glucuronide, nicotine, cotinine and trans-3\'-hydroxycotinine were monitored with tracer/benchmarker information to assess transformation during sewer transport.','2026-06-15 20:40:21','2026-06-15 20:40:21'),(456,'健康状态类','健康状态标志物','F2-异前列腺素氧化应激标志物','氧化应激/社区健康状态',NULL,'其他','8-异前列腺素F2α','27415-26-5',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'10.1038/srep39055','Wastewater analysis has been demonstrated to be a complementary approach for assessing the overall patterns of drug use by a population. F2-isoprostanes are a prototype wastewater biomarker to study the cumulative oxidative stress at a community level. In this work, 8-iso-prostaglandin F2alpha (8-iso-PGF2alpha) was analysed in raw 24 h-composite wastewater samples collected from 4 Norwegian and 7 other European cities in 2014 and 2015. Using the same samples, biomarkers of alcohol (ethyl sulfate) and tobacco (trans-3\'-hydroxycotinine) use were also analysed to investigate possible correlation with 8-iso-PGF2alpha. Estimated per capita daily loads of 8-iso-PGF2alpha ranged between 2.5 and 9.9 mg/day/1000 inhabitants with a population-weighted mean of 4.8 mg/day/1000 inhabitants.','2026-06-15 20:40:21','2026-06-15 20:40:21'),(457,'药物类','阿片类药物','阿片类镇痛药','可待因','手术/损伤疼痛','处方药','二氢可待因','125-28-0','分子式C18H23NO3；分子量301.39 g/mol',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'Wastewater-based epidemiology (WBE); COVID pandemics; Pain treatment; NSAIDs; SARS CoV-2','10.1016/j.jhazmat.2024.134121','SARS-CoV-2 pandemic had a significant impact on society, economy, and health. This study monitored four South West England WRC catchments for twenty-four months and used wastewater-based epidemiology to evaluate pain pharmaceutical usage, population-normalised daily loads, and intake changes during pandemic restrictions.','2026-06-15 20:40:21','2026-06-15 20:40:21'),(458,'消费类','烟草','烟草特异性生物碱','烟草制品',NULL,'其他','阿那巴辛','494-52-0','分子式C10H14N2；分子量162.2',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'LC-MS/MS; Influent wastewater; In-sewer stability; Tobacco biomarkers; Tobacco carcinogens; Wastewater-based epidemiology','10.1016/j.talanta.2024.126401','Tobacco-specific alkaloids and nitrosamines are important biomarkers for the estimation of tobacco use and human exposure to tobacco-specific nitrosamines that can be monitored by wastewater analysis. This study developed a direct injection LC-MS/MS method for quantification of two tobacco-specific alkaloids and five nitrosamines in wastewater. The method achieved excellent linearity, low method limits of detection and quantification, acceptable accuracy and precision, low filtration loss and low relative matrix effect. It was applied to 43 pooled influent wastewater samples from three Australian WWTPs. Anabasine and anatabine were detected in all samples; NAT, NNN and NNAL were detected in fewer than half of samples at lower concentrations. The study also assessed in-sewer stability of tobacco-specific nitrosamines and provides a high-throughput method for monitoring tobacco use and exposure to tobacco-specific nitrosamines through wastewater analysis.','2026-06-15 20:40:21','2026-06-15 20:40:21'),(459,'消费类','烟草','烟草特异性生物碱','烟草制品',NULL,'其他','阿那他宾','2743-90-0','分子式C10H12N2；分子量160.2',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'LC-MS/MS; Influent wastewater; In-sewer stability; Tobacco biomarkers; Tobacco carcinogens; Wastewater-based epidemiology','10.1016/j.talanta.2024.126401','Tobacco-specific alkaloids and nitrosamines are important biomarkers for the estimation of t