2026-06-15 20:40:21','2026-06-15 20:40:21'),(554,'药物类','抗生素','喹诺酮类','培氟沙星','抗感染治疗','处方药','培氟沙星','70458-92-3',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'10.1038/s41467-024-54498-2','This study used wastewater-based epidemiology to assess antibiotic consumption before and after the easing of China\'s zero-COVID policy. Influent wastewater was collected from five wastewater treatment plants in Eastern China during January 2021 and January/February 2023, 27 antibiotics were quantified by UPLC-MS/MS, and concentrations, daily mass loads, PNDLs and community-wide intake estimates were compared.','2026-06-15 20:40:21','2026-06-15 20:40:21'),(555,'药物类','精神神经类药物','苯二氮䓬类镇静/抗焦虑药','地西泮','焦虑、失眠、癫痫和惊厥等','处方药','去甲地西泮','1088-11-5',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'Diazepam; Metabolites; Occurrence; Consumption; Sewage-based epidemiology','10.1007/s11356-017-8922-8','Occurrence of diazepam and its metabolites, nordiazepam, temazepam, and oxazepam in the water environment in Beijing was investigated. Samples were collected from four rivers flowing through the city and from all thirteen sewage treatment plants in the urban area. Average influent concentrations were reported for summer and early winter 2013, population-normalized loads were estimated, and wastewater-based epidemiology was applied to back-calculate population-normalized diazepam consumption using temazepam as the biomarker.','2026-06-15 20:40:21','2026-06-15 20:40:21'),(556,'药物类','抗生素','喹诺酮类','莫西沙星','抗感染治疗','处方药','莫西沙星-N-硫酸盐','234080-64-9','分子量525.5；CAS未提供',NULL,35.0000,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'Chiral antibiotics; Enantioselective analysis; Wastewater-based epidemiology; Antibiotic resistance; (fluoro)quinolones; Biomarkers','10.1016/j.watres.2020.115653','Wastewater-based epidemiology was applied in seven European cities to estimate quinolone use via human urinary metabolites and to profile chiral quinolones in wastewater. The study measured quinolone and fluoroquinolone concentrations and population-normalised loads in raw wastewater, compared biomarker patterns with metabolism and prescription context, and also examined qnrS quinolone-resistance gene loads. This extraction retains only the chemical WBE concentration and population-normalised load results.','2026-06-15 20:40:21','2026-06-15 20:40:21'),(557,'药物类','抗生素','喹诺酮类','氧氟沙星','抗感染治疗','处方药','R-(+)-氧氟沙星','100986-86-5','分子式C18H20FN3O4；分子量361.4；LogP 0.65；pKa 5.45/6.20',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'Chiral antibiotics; Enantioselective analysis; Wastewater-based epidemiology; Antibiotic resistance; (fluoro)quinolones; Biomarkers','10.1016/j.watres.2020.115653','Wastewater-based epidemiology was applied in seven European cities to estimate quinolone use via human urinary metabolites and to profile chiral quinolones in wastewater. The study measured quinolone and fluoroquinolone concentrations and population-normalised loads in raw wastewater, compared biomarker patterns with metabolism and prescription context, and also examined qnrS quinolone-resistance gene loads. This extraction retains only the chemical WBE concentration and population-normalised load results.','2026-06-15 20:40:21','2026-06-15 20:40:21'),(558,'药物类','抗生素','喹诺酮类','氧氟沙星/左氧氟沙星','抗感染治疗','处方药','S-(-)-氧氟沙星-N-氧化物','117678-38-3','分子式C20H24FN3O7；分子量437.4',NULL,2.0000,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'Chiral antibiotics; Enantioselective analysis; Wastewater-based epidemiology; Antibiotic resistance; (fluoro)quinolones; Biomarkers','10.1016/j.watres.2020.115653','Wastewater-based epidemiology was applied in seven European cities to estimate quinolone use via human urinary metabolites and to profile chiral quinolones in wastewater. The study measured quinolone and fluoroquinolone concentrations and population-normalised loads in raw wastewater, compared biomarker patterns with metabolism and prescription context, and also examined qnrS quinolone-resistance gene loads. This extraction retains only the chemical WBE concentration and population-normalised load results.','2026-06-15 20:40