; Biomarkers','10.1016/j.watres.2020.115653','Wastewater-based epidemiology was applied in seven European cities to estimate quinolone use via human urinary metabolites and to profile chiral quinolones in wastewater. The study measured quinolone and fluoroquinolone concentrations and population-normalised loads in raw wastewater, compared biomarker patterns with metabolism and prescription context, and also examined qnrS quinolone-resistance gene loads. This extraction retains only the chemical WBE concentration and population-normalised load results.','2026-06-15 20:40:21','2026-06-15 20:40:21'),(562,'药物类','抗生素','喹诺酮类','莫西沙星','抗感染治疗','处方药','S,S-(-)-莫西沙星','192927-63-2','分子量455.9；LogP 2.9；pKa 5.69/9.42',NULL,45.0000,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'Chiral antibiotics; Enantioselective analysis; Wastewater-based epidemiology; Antibiotic resistance; (fluoro)quinolones; Biomarkers','10.1016/j.watres.2020.115653','Wastewater-based epidemiology was applied in seven European cities to estimate quinolone use via human urinary metabolites and to profile chiral quinolones in wastewater. The study measured quinolone and fluoroquinolone concentrations and population-normalised loads in raw wastewater, compared biomarker patterns with metabolism and prescription context, and also examined qnrS quinolone-resistance gene loads. This extraction retains only the chemical WBE concentration and population-normalised load results.','2026-06-15 20:40:21','2026-06-15 20:40:21'),(563,'药物类','造影剂','碘造影剂','碘美普尔',NULL,'处方药','碘美普尔','78649-41-9',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'WBE; Emerging contaminants; Pharmaceutical compounds removal; Pervitine; Environmental surveillance; Public health','10.1016/j.scitotenv.2023.164386','This study monitored pharmaceuticals and narcotics in the Brno wastewater system and assessed seasonal effects. Samples were collected for one year at the Brno-Modrice wastewater treatment plant. The extraction keeps only non-illicit pharmaceutical and caffeine influent-load rows from the supplied supplementary Table S5; narcotic and illicit-drug consumption back-calculations are excluded according to the project scope.','2026-06-15 20:40:21','2026-06-15 20:40:21'),(564,'药物类','抗病毒药','艾滋病/乙型肝炎治疗抗病毒药物','齐多夫定','艾滋病或乙型肝炎抗病毒治疗（论文研究对象）','处方药','齐多夫定','30516-87-1','Kd 0 L/kg；LogKow 0.05；LogKoc 1.00；25℃ 72 h稳定性变化 -24.9%',NULL,35.0000,31.8000,'mg/day/1000 people',NULL,NULL,'Antiviral drugs; Removal; Mass load; Wastewater treatment plants; Sewage epidemiology','10.1016/j.watres.2021.117803','This study investigated the occurrence, fate and mass load of 9 antiviral drugs for AIDS and hepatitis B treatment in 7 wastewater treatment plants with different treatment processes in Guangdong, China. Eight target antiviral drugs were detected in WWTP influent wastewater, effluent wastewater and sludge; entecavir was not detected. The database extraction keeps plant-level influent concentration rows and repeats the paper-reported seven-WWTP mean consumption value in those plant rows after user confirmation.','2026-06-15 20:40:21','2026-06-15 20:40:21'),(565,'药物类','抗病毒药','艾滋病/乙型肝炎治疗抗病毒药物','依非韦伦','艾滋病或乙型肝炎抗病毒治疗（论文研究对象）','处方药','依非韦伦','154598-52-4','Kd 71.7 L/kg；LogKow 4.15；LogKoc 4.477；25℃ 72 h稳定性变化 -1.94%',NULL,55.0000,24.6000,'mg/day/1000 people',NULL,NULL,'Antiviral drugs; Removal; Mass load; Wastewater treatment plants; Sewage epidemiology','10.1016/j.watres.2021.117803','This study investigated the occurrence, fate and mass load of 9 antiviral drugs for AIDS and hepatitis B treatment in 7 wastewater treatment plants with different treatment processes in Guangdong, China. Eight target antiviral drugs were detected in WWTP influent wastewater, effluent wastewater and sludge; entecavir was not detected. The database extraction keeps plant-level influent concentration rows and repeats the paper-reported seven-WWTP mean consumption value in those plant rows after user confirmation.','2026-06-15 20:40:21','2026-06-15 20:40:21'),(566,'药物类','抗病毒药','艾滋病/乙型肝炎治疗抗病毒药物','奈韦拉平','艾滋病或乙型肝炎抗病毒治疗（论文研究对象）','处方药','奈韦拉平','129618-40-2','Kd 0 L/kg；LogKow 3.89；LogKoc 3.01；25℃ 72 h稳定性变化 -4.67%',NULL,7.0000,4.1300,'mg/day/1000 people',NULL,NULL,'Antiviral drugs; Removal; Mass load; Wastewater treatment plants; Sewage epidemiology','10.1016/j.watres.2021.117803','This study investigated the occurrence, fate and mass load of 9 antiviral drugs for AIDS and hepatitis B treatment in 7 wastewater treatment plants with different treatment processes in Guangdong, China. Eight target antiviral drugs were detected in WWTP influent wastewater, effluent wastewater and sludge; entecavir was not detected. The database extraction keeps plant-level influent concentration rows and repeats the paper-reported seven-WWTP mean consumption value in those plant rows after user confirmation.','2026-06-15 20:40:21','2026-06-15 20:40:21'),(567,'药物类','抗病毒药','艾滋病/乙型肝炎治疗抗病毒药物','替比夫定','艾滋病或乙型肝炎抗病毒治疗（论文研究对象）','处方药','替比夫定','3424-98-4','Kd 5222 L/kg；LogKow -0.64；LogKoc 1.00；25℃ 72 h稳定性变化 35.4%',NULL,100.0000,1549.0000,'mg/day/1000 people',NULL,NULL,'Antiviral drugs; Removal; Mass load; Wastewater treatment plants; Sewage epidemiology','10.1016/j.watres.2021.117803','This study investigated the occurrence, fate and mass load of 9 antiviral drugs for AIDS and hepatitis B treatment in 7 wastewater treatment plants with different treatment processes in Guangdong, China. Eight target antiviral drugs were detected in WWTP influent wastewater, effluent wastewater and sludge; entecavir was not detected. The database extraction keeps plant-level influent concentration rows and repeats the paper-reported seven-WWTP mean consumption value in those plant rows after user confirmation.','2026-06-15 20:40:21','2026-06-15 20:40:21'),(568,'暴露/生活方式标志物','环境暴露标志物','内分泌干扰物/双酚类','双酚A',NULL,'其他','双酚A硫酸盐','267244-09-7',NULL,24.700000,3.0000,407.0000,'ug/day/inh',NULL,NULL,'Bisphenols; Oxidative stress biomarkers; Phosphorous flame retardants; Phthalates; Plasticizers; Wastewater-based epidemiology','10.1016/j.scitotenv.2022.157309','Wastewater-based epidemiology can assess human exposure to chemicals from personal care and household products. This study developed an on-line solid-phase extraction LC-MS/MS method for biomarkers including parabens, UV filters, phthalates and alternative plasticizers, phosphorous flame retardants/plasticizers, bisphenols, and oxidative stress biomarkers. Raw wastewater from Antwerp, Brussels, Girona, and Zagreb was analyzed, and population exposure was assessed for substances with quantitative urinary excretion data. The study reports concentration tables for raw wastewater and exposure estimates for selected compounds.','2026-06-15 20:40:21','2026-06-15 20:40:21'),(569,'消费类','酒精','酒精','乙醇','酒精消费','其他','乙醇','64-17-5',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'10.1021/acs.estlett.0c00392','Municipal wastewater typically contains many drugs and anthropogenic chemicals or biomarkers. The occurrence of these chemicals in wastewater is linked to the socioeconomic characteristics of the contributing population. This study used biomarkers in wastewater to predict 37 socioeconomic characteristics of populations during the Australian Census and tested the resulting model on separate populations. The paper evaluates whether wastewater analysis can complement population socioeconomics assessment.','2026-06-15 20:40:21','2026-06-15 20:40:21'),(570,'药物类','精神神经类药物','抗抑郁药','文拉法辛/去甲文拉法辛',NULL,'处方药','去甲文拉法辛','93413-62-8',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'10.1021/acs.estlett.0c00392','Municipal wastewater typically contains many drugs and anthropogenic chemicals or biomarkers. The occurrence of these chemicals in wastewater is linked to the socioeconomic characteristics of the contributing population. This study used biomarkers in wastewater to predict 37 socioeconomic characteristics of populations during the Australian Census and tested the resulting model on separate populations. The paper evaluates whether wastewater analysis can complement population socioeconomics assessment.','2026-06-15 20:40:21','2026-06-15 20:40:21'),(571,'药物类','降压药/心血管用药','β受体阻滞剂','噻吗洛尔','降压/β受体阻滞剂','处方药','噻吗洛尔','26839-75-8',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'Pharmaceuticals; Wastewater; Soil; Environmental risk assessment','10.1016/j.envpol.2017.12.085','The use of reclaimed wastewater for irrigation is foreseen as a possible strategy to mitigate the pressure on water resources in dry regions. However, there is the risk of potential accumulation of contaminants of emerging concern in the edaphic environment, their percolation and consequently contamination of aquifers. In the present study, the authors measured a wide range of pharmaceutically active compounds in sewage from a local wastewater treatment plant and in soils irrigated with treated wastewater. Target compounds showed total concentrations between 73 and 372 ug/L in WWTP influents and from 3 to 41 ug/L in effluents; pharmaceuticals were also detected in surface and deeper soil samples, and soil risk quotients were evaluated.','2026-06-15 20:40:21','2026-06-15 20:40:21'),(572,'药物类','抗消化性溃疡药','组胺H2受体拮抗剂','法莫替丁','组胺受体拮抗剂','非处方药','法莫替丁','76824-35-6',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'Pharmaceuticals; Wastewater; Soil; Environmental risk assessment','10.1016/j.envpol.2017.12.085','The use of reclaimed wastewater for irrigation is foreseen as a possible strategy to mitigate the pressure on water resources in dry regions. However, there is the risk of potential accumulation of contaminants of emerging concern in the edaphic environment, their percolation and consequently contamination of aquifers. In the present study, the authors measured a wide range of pharmaceutically active compounds in sewage from a local wastewater treatment plant and in soils irrigated with treated wastewater. Target compounds showed total concentrations between 73 and 372 ug/L in WWTP influents and from 3 to 41 ug/L in effluents; pharmaceuticals were also detected in surface and deeper soil samples, and soil risk quotients were evaluated.','2026-06-15 20:40:21','2026-06-15 20:40:21'),(573,'消费类','酒精','酒精消费标志物','乙醇',NULL,'其他','硫酸乙酯','540-82-9',NULL,3047.000000,NULL,19.0000,'L/day/1000 inh',NULL,NULL,'Urban wastewater; Alcohol; New psychoactive substances; Festivals; Liquid chromatography-tandem mass spectrometry','10.1016/j.ecoenv.2020.110762','Consumption of alcohol and new psychoactive substances (NPS) in a population or during special events (music festivals) is usually monitored through individual questionnaires, forensic and toxicological data, and drug seizures. However, consumption estimates have some biases due mostly to the unknown composition of drug pills for NPS and stockpiling for alcohol. The aim of this study was to evaluate for the first time the real use of alcohol and the occurrence of NPS in Slovakia by wastewater-based epidemiology (WBE). Urban wastewater samples were collected from nine Slovak cities over two years (2017-2018) and during three music festivals. The study included about 20% of the Slovak population and 50 000 festival attendees. The urinary alcohol biomarker ethyl sulfate (EtS) and thirty NPS were analyzed by liquid chromatography tandem mass spectrometry (LC - MS/MS). EtS concentrations were used for estimating the per capita alcohol consumption in each city. The average alcohol consumption in the selected cities and festivals in 2017-2018 ranged between 7 and 126 L/day/1000 inhabitants and increased during the weekends and music festivals. Five NPS belonging to the classes of synthetic cathinones (mephedrone, methcathinone, buphedrone and pentedrone) and phenethylamines (25-iP-NBoMe) were found in the low ng/L range. Methcathinone was the most frequently detected NPS, while the highest normalized mass load corresponded to mephedrone (3.1 mg/day/1000 inhabitants). Wastewater-based epidemiology can provide timely information on alcohol consumption and NPS occurrence at the community level that is complementary to epidemiology-based monitoring techniques (e.g. population surveys, police seizures, sales statistics).','2026-06-15 20:40:21','2026-06-15 20:40:21');
